TITLE Mixing DIC and Ca solutions 1:1 then heating with calcite eq
SOLUTION 1 DIC
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    C(4) 50 charge
SOLUTION 2 Ca
    temp 20
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 50
MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5
USE MIX 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0
REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10
END